	(text "VGA pinout: 1/2/3 (R/G/B coax) = LINK_A/B/C, 6/7/8 = their returns (GND), 13 HSYNC = S0,\n14 VSYNC = S1, 12 SDA = S2, 9 = +5V, 15 SCL = cable detect, 5/10 = GND, 4/11 unused.\nESD protection for these lines sits next to J3 on the main and satellite PCBs."
